    <profile name="Zealot" id="e99a-f4d0-8e6a-8cea" hidden="false" page="90" publicationId="d124-b283-pubN72234" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">When resolving an attack made with a melee weapon by a model in this unit, you can re-roll the hit roll if that model&apos;s unit made a charge move, was charged or performed a Heroic Intervention this turn.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Shield of Faith" id="79d3-165a-92b7-1d94" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Models in this unit have a 6+ invulnerable save. In addition, one model in this unit can attempt to resist one psychic power in your opponent&apos;s Psychic phase in the same manner as a PSYKER by taking a Deny the Witch test, if that model is within 24&quot; of the enemy model manifesting that psychic power. When taking that Deny the Witch test, roll one D6 instead of 2D6; the psychic power is resisted if the roll is greater than the result of the Psychic test that manifested the power.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Spiritual Fortitude" id="a302-14f9-1674-a660" hidden="false" page="110" publicationId="d124-b283-pubN72234" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time a model in this unit would lose a wound as a result of a mortal wound, roll one D6; on a 5+ that wound is not lost.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
