    <profile name="Anguish of the Unredeemed" id="c4af-275c-adf2-d2a1" hidden="false" page="115" publicationId="d124-b283-pubN72234" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time a model in this unit is destroyed by a melee attack, if this unit has not yet been selected to fight this phase, roll one D6 before removing that model from play. On a 4+, do not remove it from play. The destroyed model can fight after the attacking model&apos;s unit has finished making attacks. After doing so, any other rules that affect this model &apos;when it is destroyed&apos; are triggered (if any) and then the model is removed from play.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
