    <profile name="Zephyrim Pennant" id="7a37-e653-0597-aac6" hidden="false" page="111" publicationId="d124-b283-pubN72234" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">The bearer has the following ability: &apos;The Righteous Path (Aura): While a friendly &lt;ORDER&gt; CORE unit is within 6&quot; of this model, you can re-roll charge rolls made for that unit.&apos;</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Sky Strike" id="fa89-c68b-dfa5-8fe8" hidden="false" page="98,111" publicationId="d124-b283-pubN72234" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">During deployment, you can set up this unit in the skies instead of setting it up on the battlefield, if you do so, then in the Reinforcements step of one of your Movement phases, you can set up this unit anywhere on the battlefield that is more than 9&quot; away from any enemy models.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
