                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">If this hymn is inspiring, select one friendly ADEPTUS MINISTORUM CORE, ADEPTUS MINISTORUM CHARACTER or ENGINE OF REDEMPTION unit within 6&quot; of this PRIEST model. Until the start of your next Command phase, add 1 to the attacks characteristic of models in that unit.</characteristic>
