        <entryLink name="Character Stratagems (Named)" id="5e97-eb13-fb34-9842" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" targetId="a1f6-448c-398e-ead0" type="selectionEntryGroup"/>
        <entryLink name="Warlord Traits (Named)" id="2fa9-b9a5-3e3f-a005" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" targetId="8ae8-471a-5e6f-b335" type="selectionEntryGroup"/>
      </entryLinks>
      <infoLinks>
        <infoLink name="Zealot" id="00f4-6bbb-5d43-ccc4" hidden="false" page="90" publicationId="d124-b283-pubN72234" targetId="e99a-f4d0-8e6a-8cea" type="profile"/>
      </infoLinks>
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Wanderers" id="fc1a-994c-ab21-bf9a" hidden="false" page="100" publicationId="d124-b283-pubN72234" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">During deployment, you can set up this unit in the webway instead of setting it up on the battlefield. If you do so, then in the Reinforcements step of one of your Movement phases you can set up this unit anywhere on the battlefield that is more than 9&quot; away from any enemy models.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Divine Protection" id="e555-9d8b-3976-8bcb" hidden="false" page="100" publicationId="d124-b283-pubN72234" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Models in this units have a 4+ invulnerable save. Each time an attack is made against this unit, subtract 1 from the attack&apos;s hit roll and subtract 1 from that attack&apos;s wound roll.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Mysterious Saviour" id="ecb5-fbdd-a04b-f6ad" hidden="false" page="100" publicationId="d124-b283-pubN72234" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">While this unit contains KYGANIL, each time an attack successfully wounds this unit, that attack must be allocated to KYGANIL. Each time KYGANIL would lose a wound, roll one D6: on a 5+ that wound is not lost. The destruction of KYGANIL is ignored for the purposes of Morale tests. If EPHARAEL STERN is ever destroyed, KYGANIL is also destroyed.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Knight of Shadows" id="17a2-92fb-e351-b276" hidden="false" page="100" publicationId="d124-b283-pubN72234" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">While this unit contains KYGANIL, at the start of the Fight phase, if this unit is within Engagement Rane of any enemy units, it can fight first that phase.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Daemonifuge (Aura)" id="7001-d672-5bc8-c86c" hidden="false" page="90" publicationId="d124-b283-pubN72234" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">While a CHAOS unit is within 6&quot; of this model, subtract 1 from the Leadership characteristic of models in that unit, and each time that unit fails a Morale test, one additional model automatically flees from that unit.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Bolts of Holy Judgement" id="54de-1d0e-5b55-68f9" hidden="false" page="100" publicationId="d124-b283-pubN72234" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">At the start of your Shooting phase, roll 2D6, adding 2 to the result if there are any CHAOS units within 18&quot; of EPHRAEL STERN. on a 5+, the nearest enemy unit that is within 18&quot; of and visible to EPHRAEL STERN suffers D3 mortal wounds (if the result is 10 or more, that units instead suffers D6 mortal wounds).</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <rules>
        <rule name="Unexpected Allies" id="c7eb-dc7c-0568-b3f6" hidden="false" page="100" publicationId="d124-b283-pubN72234">
          <description>This unit can only be included in an ADEPTA SORORITAS Detachment or in an Auxiliary Support Detachment. EPHRAEL STERN cannot be selected as your WARLORD if she is included in an Auxiliary Support Detachment..</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
