        <profile name="Sisters Novitiate" id="0823-ffa4-2399-975e" hidden="false" publicationId="d124-b283-pubN72234" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">If your army is Battle-forged, you cannot include more SISTERS NOVITIATE units than BATTLE SISTERS SQUAD units in each ADEPTA SORORITAS Detachment in your army.</characteristic>
