              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">PRIEST model only.

- The bearer knows one additional hymn from the Hymns of Battle (pg 73).
- In your Command phase, the bearer can intone one additional hymn that it knows that has not already been intoned by a friendly model that turn.</characteristic>
