              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">IMAGIFIER model only. At the start of the battle, before the first turn begins, you must select two tales for the bearer to recount instead of just one. You cannot select a tale that another model from your army is already recounting unless all three tales are being recounted by models from your army.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
