                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">ORDER OF THE VALOROUS HEART model only. The bearer has the following ability: &apos;Casket of Penance (Aura): While an enemy unit is within 3&quot; of the bearer, subtract 1 from the Toughness characteristic of models in that enemy unit (if that unit has the CHAOS keyword, subtract 1 from its Strength characteristic as well).&apos;</characteristic>
