                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time you select a target for this model&apos;s ranged weapons, you can ignore the Look Out, Sir rule, Each time this model makes a ranged attack, an unmodified wound roll of 6 inflicts 1 mortal wound on the target in addition to any normal damage.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
