                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">At the start of the Fight phase, you can select one enemy unit within 3&quot; of this model. That unit is not eligible to fight this phase until after all eligible units from your army have done so.</characteristic>
