                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">At the start of your opponent&apos;s Command phase, select one enemy unit within 6&quot; of this model and select one Aura ability that unit has. Roll 3D6: if the result is equal to or greater than that enemy unit&apos;s Leadership characteristic, then until the start of your opponent&apos;s next Command phase, that enemy unit loses that Aura Ability.</characteristic>
