              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">If this hymn is inspiring, select one friendly ADEPTUS SORORITAS CORE or ADEPTUS SORORITAS CHARACTER unit within 6&quot; of this PRIEST model. Each time a model in that unit makes a ranged attack with a bolt weapon:
An unmodified hit roll of 6 automatically wounds the target.
If that attack targets a unit within half range, the Armour Penetration characteristic of that attack is improved by 1.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
