              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">ORDER OF THE BLOODY ROSE model only.

- The bearer has a Save characteristic of 2+.
- If the bearer loses on or more wounds during a phase, at the end of that phase, you gain 1 Miracle dice (see Codex: Adepta Sororitas).</characteristic>
